    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d213">

                <pb facs="0300" n="196" xml:id="pg196"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/3892: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Japan
                        (Forbes)</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-02-03T12:00:00-05:00">February 3,
                        1932—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>35. Your 37, February 3, 5 p.m., last paragraph. The Consul General at Shanghai
                    has been instructed in accordance with your request.</p>
                <p>The Department requests from you fuller and more frequent reports, if possible,
                    of events and opinion in Tokyo.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
